"25"},"order":0},{"fullName":"Liam Maaskant","displayName":"Liam Maaskant","position":{"name":"Referee","displayName":"Referee","id":"24"},"order":0}]},"article":{"headline":"Snuggerud's goal, assist help power the Blues to a 3-2 victory over the Red Wings","description":"— Jimmy Snuggerud had a goal and an assist and his score in the third period was the winner as the St. Louis Blues beat the Detroit Red Wings 3-2 on Tuesday night.","story":"ST. LOUIS -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5080171/jimmy-snuggerud\">Jimmy Snuggerud</a> had a goal and an assist and his score in the third period was the winner as the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/stl/st-louis-blues\">St. Louis Blues</a> beat the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/det/detroit-red-wings\">Detroit Red Wings</a> 3-2 on Tuesday night.\n\n\r\n              Snuggerud scored on a deflection with 4:02 left. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4697397/dylan-holloway\">Dylan Holloway</a> got an assist on the go-ahead goal. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4271732/pius-suter\">Pius Suter</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4697408/justin-barron\">Justin Barron</a> also scored for the Blues, who snapped a three-game skid. St. Louis had lost five of its last seven games before Tuesday.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4565227/moritz-seider\">Moritz Seider</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3042114/andrew-copp\">Andrew Copp</a> scored for the Red Wings, who dropped their fifth straight and lost for the fifth time in six games.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4587909/joel-hofer\">Joel Hofer</a> stopped 30 shots in the win for the Blues. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/2590824/john-gibson\">John Gibson</a>, back in the lineup after sustaining a lower-body injury in a game against Tampa Bay on Nov. 3, had 30 saves for the Red Wings.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Red Wings: At the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/fla/florida-panthers\">Florida Panthers</a> on Thursday.\n\n\r\n              Blues: At the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/utah/utah-mammoth\">Utah Mammoth</a> on Thursday.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-11-11T04:04:43Z"}}